Will not be adopted for enterprise customers.
Reason: 
    System configuration is not capable of that.
    Revenue Contract Grouping logic.
    Performance Obligation for Distinct and Non-Distinct setup.
    Standalone Selling Price Setup.
    Accounting entries will not balance at the line level.
    Scaling for high volume is not possible.
    Currency rounding precision.
    No independent, RevRec-specific scheduled jobs.
    Not capable of writing custom code and jobs to support customer-specific logic.
    If one line fails, the entire job fails.
    No inbound staging area where users can correct failed data and re-collect it after fixing.

Functionality Not Available:
    Intercompany is not supported.
    Multi-currency allocation is not supported.
    LongTerm and ShortTerm accounting. 
    Upload the ManualJournal to correct the month end value.
    CA/CL accounting.